  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Aniline reacts with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NaNO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>HCl</mi></math> to form benzene diazonium chloride which further reacts with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi></math> napthol to give a scarlet red dye.</p><p>The reaction is as follows,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ead7acd0-9537-4189-b1f3-f59d80566045.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 399px;\"/></p><p>Hence here,<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/eb74b7dd-0744-4744-8c18-5ee5659c7e78.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 151px;\"/></p>",
